@baseUrl = http://localhost:8300/api
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token

### 批量生成（需要登录；每行一个 IP；重复 IP 保留）
POST {{baseUrl}}/klash/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ips": "192.0.2.1\n2001:db8::1\n192.0.2.1"
}

### 非法 IP：HTTP 400，错误指出原始输入行号
POST {{baseUrl}}/klash/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ips": "192.0.2.1\ninvalid"
}
